Version 1.26.1 — 2026-11-12
Previous GitHub release: v1.26.0 (2026-11-12)

Overview
--------
ZGeo 1.26.1 shows the name of the current check or operation directly
above the progress bar at the bottom of the panel.

Changes in 1.26.1
-----------------
- Added a label above the progress bar that displays:
  - the name of the current check (or the list of selected checks);
  - "Scanning folder…" during scanning;
  - the refinement action name (size, CRS or feature count) when a
    refinement is running.
- The label is updated when the language is switched while an operation
  is running.
- The label and the progress bar are hidden when the operation finishes.
- README, metadata, translations and tests were updated.

Available checks in 1.26.1
--------------------------
Refinement:
- Refine size (all formats, including SHP and MIF/MID)
- Refine CRS and check it
- Refine feature count and check empty layers

Validation:
- Check JSON for GeoJSON format
- Field name check
- Dataset integrity check
- Geometry and coordinate check

Excel export sheets
-------------------
- "Files" — the filtered file list;
- "Statistics" — statistics by format;
- one sheet per problem check with issues;
